  "legalCgu1Body": "These Terms of Use govern access to and use of the WinPlus platform, an educational mobile application for students, parents and teachers in the Cameroonian school system.",
  "legalCgu1Title": "1. Purpose",
  "legalCgu2Body": "WinPlus is open to anyone with a compatible device and an internet connection. Some features require creating an account. Registration is free for the basic plan.",
  "legalCgu2Title": "2. Access to the platform",
  "legalCgu3Body": "You are responsible for keeping your login details confidential. Any activity carried out from your account is attributed to you. If your account is compromised, contact us immediately at support@winplus.cm.",
  "legalCgu3Title": "3. User accounts",
  "legalCgu4Body": "The content published on WinPlus (papers, corrections, quizzes) is protected by copyright. Reproducing, redistributing or reselling it without permission is strictly prohibited.",
  "legalCgu4Title": "4. Content and intellectual property",
  "legalCgu5Body": "Paid plans (Starter, Expert, Institution) are billed monthly via Mobile Money (MTN MoMo, Orange Money) or bank card. Prices are shown in CFA francs (XAF) and may change with 30 days' notice.",
  "legalCgu5Title": "5. Subscriptions and payments",
  "legalCgu6Body": "You can cancel your subscription at any time from your profile. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. No partial refund is granted.",
  "legalCgu6Title": "6. Cancellation",
  "legalCgu7Body": "WinPlus strives to keep the platform available 24/7, but cannot be held liable for service interruptions, data loss or inaccuracies in the content.",
  "legalCgu7Title": "7. Liability",
  "legalCgu8Body": "These Terms of Use are governed by Cameroonian law. Any dispute will be brought before the competent courts of Yaoundé, Cameroon.",
  "legalCgu8Title": "8. Governing law",
  "legalCguTitle": "Terms of Use",
  "legalContactBody": "For any question: support@winplus.cm\nWinPlus SAS, Yaoundé, Cameroon",
  "legalContactTitle": "Contact",
  "legalLastUpdated": "Last updated: 1 June 2025",
  "legalPriv1Body": "WinPlus collects the following data:\n• Identification data: last name, first name, email address\n• Browsing data: content viewed, quiz results\n• Payment data: sent directly to our providers (MTN, Orange)\n• Device data: model, operating system, advertising identifier",
  "legalPriv1Title": "1. Data collected",
  "legalPriv2Body": "Your data is used to:\n• Provide and personalise the WinPlus services\n• Generate learning recommendations through WinAI\n• Process your payments and manage your subscription\n• Improve the platform through aggregated, anonymised analyses",
  "legalPriv2Title": "2. Purposes of processing",
  "legalPriv3Body": "Processing is based on your consent (art. 4 of Cameroon law no. 2010/012 on electronic communications) and on the performance of the service contract formed by these Terms of Use.",
  "legalPriv3Title": "3. Legal basis",
  "legalPriv4Body": "Your data is kept for the duration of your contractual relationship with WinPlus, plus 3 years for evidential purposes. Browsing data is anonymised after 13 months.",
  "legalPriv4Title": "4. Data retention",
  "legalPriv5Body": "WinPlus does not sell your data. It may be shared with:\n• Our hosting providers (secure servers in Europe)\n• Our payment providers (MTN, Orange, Stripe)\n• The competent authorities where required by law",
  "legalPriv5Title": "5. Data sharing",
  "legalPriv6Body": "In accordance with the applicable legislation, you have the rights of access, rectification, erasure, portability and objection. Exercise them by writing to privacy@winplus.cm.",
  "legalPriv6Title": "6. Your rights",
  "legalPriv7Body": "The app uses anonymous identifiers to measure performance and improve the user experience. You can turn them off in your device settings.",
  "legalPriv7Title": "7. Cookies and trackers",
  "legalPrivacyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
